    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwo baasoma mu kitabo kya Musa ng'abantu boonaboona bawulira. Baayagaanamu nga kyaghandiikibwa kiti: “Omuammoni n'Omumoabu yeenayeena, taabalirwenga mu bantu ba Katonda,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.23.3+DEU.23.4+DEU.23.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 23:3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba abantu abo baaloba okugha Abaisiraeli emere n'amaadhi mu lugendo lwaibwe nga buli kuva e Misiri. Era baagulirira Balaamu abakolimire. Aye Katonda waife mu kifo eky'ekikolimo, yaatughaamu nkabi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.22.1+NUM.22.2+NUM.22.3+NUM.22.4+NUM.22.5+NUM.22.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 22:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bwe baawulira eiteeka eryo, baayawula mu Baisiraeli abantu boonaboona abaasimuka mu bamaghanga agandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo nga bikaali kubaagho, Eliashibu kabona eyateebwagho okukuliranga ebimante by'omu isinzizo lya Katonda waife, yali ali n'enkolagana ni Tobia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale yaaghaaku Tobia oyo ekisenge ekinene, mu kusooka kye baatangamu: ebigheebwayo eby'emere ey'empeke, n'obubbaani, n'ebintu ebikozesebwa mu isinzizo, n'ebigheebwayo eby'ekitundu ekirala ekirala ku buli bitundu eikumi omuntu bye yafunanga eky'engaano, n'omwenge ogw'emizabbibu, n'omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva. Ebintu ebyo, kyabanga kya iteeka nga bali n'okubigha: Abalevi, n'abembi, n'abakuumi ab'emiryango, era nga bali n'okusoloza eby'okugha bakabona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ate ebyo byaja okubaagho nga nze tiri mu Yerusalemu, kuba mu mwaka ogwamakumi asatu n'ebiri (32) ogw'obufuzi bwa kyabazinga Arutazerizesi ow'e Babilonia, nali nga njiire Babilonia ye kyabazinga mwene oyo. Aye nga ghabiseeghooku entangama, naamusaba yanganha, naira e Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe natuuka e Yerusalemu, naakizuula ekibi ekyo Eliashibu kabona kye yakola, okugha Tobia ekisenge ekiri mu isinzizo lya Katonda waife. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naasungughala inho era naatoola mu kisenge ekyo ebintu bya Tobia byonabyona, naabisuula kuliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho naalagira batukuze ekisenge ekyo. Bwe baamala okukitukuza naizaamu ebintu ebikozesebwa mu isinzizo, n'ebigheebwayo eby'emere ey'empeke, n'obubbaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era naakizuula nti Abalevi n'abembi baali tibakaafuna migabo gyaibwe, kale nga baalumuka ku mirimo gyaibwe, buli muntu yairirayo mu kibandha kye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.12.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 12:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale neemuluguunhiza abafuzi nti: “Lwaki endhu ya Katonda mugirese bw'agho mutyo?” Agho naamala naaja, naasoloza Abalevi n'abembi, naabaiza ku mirimo gyaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo Abayudaaya boonaboona baatoolera okuleeta mu materekero ekitundu ekirala ekirala ku buli bitundu eikumi omuntu by'afuna eky'engaano, n'omwenge ogw'emizabbibu, n'omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAL.3.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 3:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho naataagho abantu bano babenga abaghanika mu materekero ago: Shelemia kabona, Zadoki omunamateeka, ni Pedaia Omulevi. Era naabagha Hanani mutabane wa Zakkuri era mwidhukulu wa Mattania, okubayambangaku. Abantu abo baali nga bamanhiibwa okuba abeesigwa, era omulimo gwaibwe gwali gwa kughanga Balevi banaibwe emigabo gyaibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naasaba nti: “Wo Katonda wange, oteerabiranga ebyo ebirungi bye nkoleire eisinzizo lyo, n'emirimo gye bakoleramu okukusinza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mu biseera ebyo, naabonanga mu Buyudaaya abantu abakunha omwenge ogw'emizabbibu ku lunaku lwa Sabbato! Abandi baatwikanga ku ndogoyi dhaibwe, emungo edh'engaano, n'omwenge gw'emizabbibu, n'emizabbibu gyene, n'ebibala eby'emiti emitiini, n'emigugu egya buli nsambo. Abantu abo naababonanga nga baleeta ebintu ebyo mu Yerusalemu ku lunaku lwa Sabbato! Aye nze naabalabulanga obutatunda kintu kyonakyona ku lunaku lwa Sabbato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.20.8+EXO.20.9+EXO.20.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 20:8-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.5.12+DEU.5.13+DEU.5.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 5:12-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.17.21+JER.17.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 17:21-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaabaagho n'abantu ab'e Tiro abaabanga mu Yerusalemu, baaleetanga ebyenhandha n'eby'amatano ebya buli nsambo, baabiguza Abayudaaya ku lwa Sabbato mu Yerusalemu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale neemuluguunhiza abakungu mu Buyudaaya: ‘Lwaki muli kukola ekibi kino eky'okwonoona olunaku lwa Sabbato? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badhaadha baimwe batyo ti bwe baakola, memale Katonda n'atuleetaku obuzibu buno bwonabwona, ife ni ku kibuga kino? Aye ate kabiri muli kwenda kuleetera Katonda oyo okusungughalira Isiraeli, nga mwonoona olunaku lwa Sabbato.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale naalagira okwigalanga emiryango egingira mu Yerusalemu nga buli kuziba, ng'enkyo n'olunaaba olwa Sabbato, era girobe kwigulwanga okutuusa ng'olwa Sabbato lubise. Naata abandi ku bagheereza bange ku miryango egyo bagikuume, obutaikiriza kwingiza kintu kyonakyona mu Yerusalemu ku Sabbato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo ku mikuzi ng'oti ebiri, abasuubuzi ghalala n'abo abaali batunda ebintu ebya buli nsambo, baasula kuliya kwa Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye naabalabula nti: “Mulekere agho okusulanga okumpi n'ekisenge eky'ekibuga. Bwe munairayo okusulagho ndidha kubagema.” Okuva ku olwo tibairayo kwidhanga ku Sabbato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale naalagira Abalevi okwetukuza, bamale baje bakuume emiryango olw'okukuuma Sabbato nga ntukuvu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho naasaba nti: “Wo Katonda wange, oteerabiranga n'ekyo kyona kye nkoze. Nkweghemba onsaasirenga, ongonze obutalekera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu biseera ebyo, era naabona Abayudaaya abaabayiza abakazi abaava mu Ashidodi, ni mu Ammoni, ni mu Moabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
